WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:02.730
Knights! Mercenaries!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.980
Let's go!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.660
Our battlefield is Orléans, 
which will fall without us!

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.200
I won't let you become the heroic savior.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.740
Montmorency!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.660
Alençon!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.290
I'm not alone.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.290
Th-That military force...

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.380
It's my sister's private army.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.750
All troops, pull back!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.250
We're making a tactical withdrawal!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.160
You must become a true knight.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.510
We'll have a chance to win, 
if Montmorency can reach Jeanne.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.140
Let's go!

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:45.350
They're taking one point of strategic 
importance after another!

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.100
Commander Campbell died in battle!

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.110
We've received a report that the black 
alchemist already entered the fortress!

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.310
The elixir is drying up inside her, 
so the scabbard is not reacting.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:02.660
The cursed princess will wake up 
with the prince's baiser.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.250
Montmorency...

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:30.270
<b>#09 Dance Music of White and Black.</b>

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.510
Jeanne d'Arc and the Alchemist Knight

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.040
It's... over.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:07.820
Not yet.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.170
Don't give up yet!

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.480
Our battle is not yet over!

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:19.920
Everyone, I have recovered!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.960
I'm the Maiden of Domremy!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:27.000
I promise you that I won't die 
until I lead France to victory!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.560
Let's fight together,

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.630
and take down the Tourelles complex!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.340
It sounds as if Jesus Christ was resurrected

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.560
after his execution at Golgotha.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:52.080
It seems they have obtained 
some form of healing power.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:57.920
If only you had crushed her head 
as we originally planned...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.910
Taking you with her?

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.840
That's what you should've done.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:11.480
Do not hesitate this time, 
and strike her head, Glasdale.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:26.810
There was a certain archer in the past.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.970
He was a bastard who 
boasted about his skills.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.750
That brought him unwanted 
attention from the feudal lord.

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:40.440
Shooting an apple on his wife's head

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:44.510
would have been within his capability.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.280
However...

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.460
Don't worry.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.520
I don't fear death.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.340
In fact, I welcome it.

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:03.820
Death is salvation for a cursed Ulysses.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.210
It would bring me happiness.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.740
<i>You welcome death?</i>

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:29.400
<i>I was anticipating it when I put on 
the Holy Grail for the very first time.</i>

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:35.530
<i>I was hoping maybe I would not 
be chosen by the Holy Grail and die.</i>

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:43.070
<i>But Montmorency's Elixir 
turned me into Ulysses.</i>

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:50.910
<i>It was your destiny from birth
to become the empress of the world.</i>

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.210
<i>You are not permitted 
to die until that happens.</i>

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.050
<i>That is your destiny!</i>

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.090
Montmorency...

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.540
Residents of Orléans 
have started an uprising.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.680
They plan to open the castle gate,

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.240
cross the Loire River with a group of ships,

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.960
and build a bridge towards 
the Tourelles complex.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:25.830
We will be attacking from both sides, 
with our soldiers at Augustine's Fortress.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.950
What's the movement of the English army?

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.090
They've gathered at the complex.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:33.050
They probably intend 
to repel the civilians first.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.690
I have to rush to their aid!

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.330
You have to remain here.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.470
Huh?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.960
We didn't revive you so that 
you could return to the battlefield.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:45.800
I should just cheer 
for everybody from safety?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.600
That's not right!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:52.150
A single Ulysses can only absorb 
a single Philosopher's Stone.

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:54.220
That's the rule.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:01.920
You were able to absorb 
the power of Escalibor's scabbard,

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.390
because you had only
 absorbed half a stone.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:06.080
But it's one time only.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.520
You can never use the power 
of the scabbard again.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:11.320
It means that we will not 
be able to revive you again

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.870
if you take another hit 
from Glasdale's arrow.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.440
We wouldn't be able to face Princess Charlotte

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.250
if something were to happen to you again.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.880
Leave this to me and Xaintrailles.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:28.460
Also, we have 2,000 reinforcement soldiers!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.470
What?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.150
The Gilles de Rais Squadron!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.520
Montmorency brought them from his home!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.350
The black Ulysses appeared 
on the Loire Bridge!

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:03.130
I'm being painted with lust... for blood!

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.140
Jeanne!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.580
Forgive me. I'm arrogant when I'm Ulysses.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.740
All right, you nitwits!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:39.860
Commence Anti-Jeanne Tactic Number Two!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.250
All units, your target is above the bridge!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.880
Noire will lure Jeanne to the location!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.250
Jeanne...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.600
Montmorency!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.440
Don't bother shooting now!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.190
You won't hit her while she's accelerating!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.680
<i>If I can turn the Ulysses into ashes,</i>

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:15.940
<i>the weak French bastards will 
return to their cowardly selves.</i>

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:25.510
Noire!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.050
It's the maiden!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:32.980
We're saved!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.180
We'll help!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.880
Stay back!

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:39.830
But...

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.020
I'm saying that your 
determination alone is enough.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.590
The power I've borrowed from 
all of you is moving me right now!

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:59.790
Idiot! You can't get past the 
Tourelles complex all on your own!

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.950
Can't you see that?!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.710
Montmorency!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.080
Why are you rushing off all on your own?

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:11.060
Have you forgotten?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.450
You have comrades with you.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.050
That's right.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.840
We're all willing to risk our lives with you!

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.180
Montmorency?

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.350
"Please lend me your strength for France."

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:34.650
I'm not great enough 
to say something like that.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.770
I've only done whatever I could 
to keep my promise with my friends.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:43.020
Just until a few days ago,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.660
I didn't even know 
what it meant to love others...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.300
That was the kind of a child that I was.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:51.910
So this is what I'll say instead!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.750
Please lend me your strength 
for the woman I love!

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.670
The French army is heading our way!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.660
Wait for us, Jeanne-chan!

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:25.780
Montmorency is heading your way!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.310
What's wrong with these guys?!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.990
They're monstrously strong!

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:32.540
N-No, I don't want to die in a foreign land!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:36.040
This is where we'll die!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.560
Hurry, Montmorency!

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.550
Leave them to us!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.750
Hurry, Montmorency!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.060
All right!

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:50.420
<i>Wait for me, Jeanne.</i>

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:53.320
<i>I won't let you fight all alone.</i>

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.110
<i>Until the very last moment...</i>

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.120
<i>I'll be right beside you!</i>

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.690
Jeanne!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.080
Too slow!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.540
But I can't die.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:23.280
This helmet possesses 
the ultimate power of healing.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.800
The Holy Grail.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.950
It's no use, no matter how 
many times you cut me.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.690
Then I'll crush your head, 
along with the helmet next time!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.900
Be careful. They're aiming 
at you from the complex.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.350
I know.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.980
<i>The only thing I need to fear 
is the Holy Lance arrow.</i>

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.970
<i>But Glasdale can't 
keep up with my acceleration.</i>

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.030
<i>Neither can Noire.</i>

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.770
<i>I'll win this fight.</i>

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.260
Gilles de Rais Squadron...

00:12:55.580 --> 00:13:00.500
I wonder how Montmorency managed 
to obtain 2,000 reinforcement soldiers.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.760
You really don't know anything!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.980
Jeanne!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:31.160
Montmorency received his family fortune 
and army from Jean the Redbeard.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:34.730
But Jean the Redbeard is not a kind person.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.120
He must have had a condition...

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.140
Like marrying his cousin, Catherine.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:43.260
Jeanne!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.700
Are you safe?

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.100
Jeanne?

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.990
Did you break your promise?

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.080
You said you would be with me forever...

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.310
That you would never get married.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:01.270
Afww... Your heart is broken.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.670
Montmorency, what am I to you?

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.980
Am I just a weapon to fight 
against the English army?

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.190
Of course not, Jeanne!

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.930
I had no other way!

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.040
And Catherine is just...

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:21.040
Jeanne!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.960
Don't interrupt our conversation!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.660
You shouldn't be so easily provoked

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.510
to strike your opponent's head.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:31.930
That's a mistake!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.450
Jeanne!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.900
Now, aim!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.180
No!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.920
Wait! Don't tell me...

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.740
Fire!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.490
This is...

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.900
Only one is real.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:02.220
But you can't tell which.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:06.590
And you can't accelerate in air.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:10.010
Let's die, Jeanne!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:36.570
Sheesh, you're the most 
troublesome lady in the world.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.580
Montmorency!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.750
I realized it the moment 
I swallowed the stone.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.860
The Philosopher's Stone I swallowed 
was the other half of yours.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:56.090
If your power is offensive, 
then my power must be defensive!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.090
The two of us make one!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.020
What?!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.420
The ability to turn air harder than steel...

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:13.660
I guess I'll call it Mur D'Air, 
or the wall of air, for now.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.160
Are you telling me that you 
swallowed the Philosopher's Stone?

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.120
How can you do something so foolish?!

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:22.270
You can only stay as 
Ulysses for three minutes.

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:26.080
Your body will keep transmuting elixir, 
which will react with the Philosopher's Stone,

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.050
causing it to spiral out of control.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.200
You may die of madness after 
the stone takes over your mind,

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.380
or you may simply explode.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.470
In any case, there can 
only be horrible consequences.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.790
I'll rip the stone out of your stomach!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.010
That's insane! Are you trying to kill me?

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.670
Jeanne!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.110
I hardened the air around her feet!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.610
Now's the chance, Jeanne!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.220
I can't crush that helmet!

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.490
You still have to try!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.580
We're both running out of time!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.240
Go, Jeanne!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.880
The result is the same, 
no matter how many times you try!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.760
Glasdale!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.140
Ashes to ashes, the dead should 
head to the realm of the dead!

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:20.790
Come on! Crush our heads with that arrow!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.160
I won't let you die yet!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.700
Glasdale!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:36.120
You'll be a loser for the rest of 
your life if you chicken out now!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.830
I wont let it happen!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.540
Pierce it!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.300
Oh, no!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.350
Jeanne!

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:10.860
Glasdale...

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:15.800
You hesitated...

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:28.410
Loved by Montmorency...

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.710
You hoarded it all...

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.670
Noire?!

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.900
Montmorency...

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.590
We won...

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.170
The maiden is victorious!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.700
Montmorency!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.270
Is your body all right?

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.600
Yeah.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:36.360
I felt weird for a second,

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.740
but I'm fine, as you can see.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.300
Your prediction wasn't 
very reliable, after all.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:48.080
Man, I should've just become 
Ulysses from the startー

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:51.670
What's wrong?

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:54.390
It's... nothing.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:13.640
Are you serious? What is that?

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:16.780
Could that be the English 
army's magic or something?

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.900
No, it's not.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.650
It's...

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.530
It's...

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.810
Who would've thought that love...

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.420
An act of love....

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.950
would trigger the end of the world?

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.210
The unfolding of the fifth dimension...

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:45.990
The unfolding of the sixth dimension...

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.080
The unfolding of the seventh dimension...

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:54.830
This can't be happening!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.190
No way!

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:08.190
I never thought the Philosopher's Stone 
would go out of control in this way...

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:09.370
This is going out of control?

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.960
I thought I was just going 
to die, and that was it!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.710
What is that?

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.960
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>#10 Beast of the Apocalypse</b>

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:22.710
I heard from English soldiers,

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.150
that breasts are called "boobs" in English.

00:23:25.150 --> 00:23:27.320
There's an "s" in the end 
because there are two, plural!

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:28.460
This is going to be on the test!

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:30.750
Episode 10: "Beast of the Apocalypse."

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.540
"Ulysses" improves your
 standardized test scores.

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:34.340
Recommended for upcoming graduates!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Surprisingly useful French lesson</b>

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>"Stay back!"</b>

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Use it when you protect your allies!</b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:41.980
<b></b>
